Make Dask dataframe test expectations portable to 32-bit hosts.

Use explicit int64 fixtures where partition reductions/Parquet use int64;
allow native-width versus widened integer memory counts; derive scalar repr
from intp; check repartition size constraints rather than pointer-size-specific
partition counts. Include i686 in the existing x86 categorical-concat xfail.

--- a/dask/dataframe/dask_expr/tests/test_collection.py
